<h3>Power of Ancora</h3>
<p>
    The essence of Nexus of Eternity is Power of Ancora.
    PoA drops from mobs and Vloxx every 10% of his HP.
</p>
<p>
    Like in other convergences, gathering these increases your damage while taking away your health.
</p>
<p>
    Unlike other convergences,
    when you reach 50 stacks, all 50 will be automatically consumed.
    This slows Vloxx's plan and charges Isgarren's resurrection spell.
    In compensation, you get a powerful skill on your SAK.
</p>